					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE: FORCING A NAN\n\nIn this example we are forcing a NaN by normalizing 0, which is not possible and therefore produces a NaN.\nThis is not something you would do while making a patch, but it makes for a simple example on dealing with NaN's.\n\nWe use a Switch to Switch out the NaN value and send out 0.5 instead."
					}
				},
