					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "IS NAN\n\nThe Is NaN node tells you whether the given input is NaN (not a number).\nThis node is here to help you detect when somehow a NaN is computed and you have to decide how to handle this.\n\nNaN is mathematic's way of saying: “bruv! somethin's wrong bruv!”\n"
